Unit 9, Stress, and How to Beat It Music has soothing power.

g11-audio-9-2
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:20.780
It has a unique link to our emotions, so it can be an extremely effective stress management tool.

g11-audio-9-3
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:27.740
Listening to music can have a very relaxing effect on our minds and bodies, especially slow,

g11-audio-9-4
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.720
quiet classical music.

g11-audio-9-5
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:38.140
This type of music can have a beneficial effect on our physiological functions, it can slow the pulse and heart rate,

g11-audio-9-6
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:42.480
lower blood pressure, and decrease the levels of stress hormones.

g11-audio-9-7
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:49.140
Music, in short, enact as a powerful stress management tool in our lives.

g11-audio-9-8
00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.700
Musical preference varies widely between individuals.

g11-audio-9-9
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.380
Only you can decide what you like and what is suitable for each mood.

g11-audio-9-10
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:07.280
But even if you don't usually listen to classical music, it may be worth giving it try when selecting the most calming music.

g11-audio-9-11
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.140
When people are stressed out, there is a tendency to avoid actively listening to music.

g11-audio-9-12
00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:18.720
Perhaps it feels like a waste of time, not helping to achieve anything.

g11-audio-9-13
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:28.060
To incorporate music into a busy life, try playing CDs in the car, or put the radio on when in the bath or shower.

g11-audio-9-14
00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:34.540
Take portable music with you walking the dog, or put the stereo on instead of the TV.

g11-audio-9-15
00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:43.300
Singing or shouting alone can also be a great release of tension, and karaoke is very enjoyable for some people.

g11-audio-9-16
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:50.060
Calming music before bedtime promotes peace and relaxation and helps to induce sleep.
